@startuml View_Pending_Topic_Proposals
title Activity Diagram - View Pending Topic Proposals

|Instructor|
start
:Open Instructor Dashboard;
:Click "Pending Proposals";

|Web Application|
:Send request to retrieve\npending topic proposals;

|Backend API|
:Extract instructorId\nfrom JWT token;
:Call TopicProposalService.\nGetPendingProposalsAsync(instructorId);
:Query MilestoneSubmissions:\n- Where class instructorId = {instructorId}\n- Where milestone title contains "Proposal"\n- Where no approval history\n  (Approved/Rejected);
:Include related data:\n- Project\n- Group\n- Leader\n- Files\n- ApprovalHistory;

if (Proposals found?) then (yes)
  :Map to TopicProposalResponseDto;
  :Return List<TopicProposalResponseDto>;
  :Send 200 OK response;
else (no)
  :Return empty list;
  :Send 200 OK response;
endif

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display pending proposals list\nwith project details and files;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Instructor|
:View pending topic proposals;
stop
@enduml

